<title>USA: Polaroid licenses technology to Bosch.</title>
<headline>Polaroid licenses technology to Bosch.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polaroid Corp said on Thursday that it had agreed to license technology and patents covering ultrasonic transducers to Robert Bosch Corp, a U.S. unit of Robert Bosch GmbH of Germany.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Polaroid said the agreement permits Bosch, a maker of automotive systems and components, to use the licensed technology in its automotive occupancy sensors for &quot;smart&quot; airbags.</p>
</text>
